Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:34:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ledger): public /api/transparency open ledger +
 on-chain indexer

Public, read-only, cached endpoints (overview, flows, plantings, planting detail, map, onchain, contracts, status) behind CORS * and their own rate limit; the origin allowlist exempts the path. A ledger indexer reads Base under a Mongo lease and writes one OnchainEvent per MGRO mint/burn (0x0 and 0xdEaD), minter proposal/execution/verifier share (V4, V6, AutoMinterV7 and the revoked minters), MangrovesRetired certificate and ERC-20 payout leg from completed distribution receipts. Mints are linked to plantings from the proposal's evidenceURI first, then from RewardAllocation/Submission/HealthCheck mint hashes. Tree counts use the verifier-corrected effective count; OTC buyers are labelled. DonationFlow model and donation totals for the foundation pipeline (data model only; see docs/TREASURY_PIPELINE.md). DISABLE_LEDGER_INDEXER turns the indexer off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

